46
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:50,230
It's a real drive-by cutie.

47
00:01:50,230 --> 00:01:51,774
- Wow, that's a terrific idea.

48
00:01:51,774 --> 00:01:53,864
I'll tell you why, because
you can take party,

49
00:01:53,864 --> 00:01:55,304
wait a minute, how?

50
00:01:55,304 --> 00:01:56,297
