79
00:02:46,112 --> 00:02:47,975
- [Mother] And don't you
dare kill this boyfriend

80
00:02:47,975 --> 00:02:49,650
like you did the last one, Clayton.

81
00:02:49,650 --> 00:02:51,271
- Yes, Mother.

82
00:02:51,271 --> 00:02:52,433
Hi, guys.

83
00:02:52,433 --> 00:02:54,620
Mom has a date tonight.

84
00:02:54,620 --> 00:02:55,868
(doorbell rings)

85
00:02:55,868 --> 00:02:57,425
- [Mother] Clayton, be a dear, get that?

86
00:02:57,425 --> 00:02:59,079
- Sure.

87
00:02:59,079 --> 00:03:01,169
There's nothing else I need to do.

88
00:03:01,169 --> 00:03:02,652
I'm your personal slave, that's probably

89
00:03:02,652 --> 00:03:03,719
