90
00:03:03,719 --> 00:03:05,020
(doorbell rings)

91
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:05,853
It's open!

92
00:03:06,759 --> 00:03:08,199
(door squeaking)

93
00:03:08,199 --> 00:03:09,383
