94
00:03:09,383 --> 00:03:10,216
- Uh, hi.

95
00:03:10,216 --> 00:03:11,844
Mom, that guy is here.

96
00:03:11,844 --> 00:03:12,911
- I'm Sandy.

97
00:03:12,911 --> 00:03:14,628
You must be Pearl's boy.

98
00:03:14,628 --> 00:03:16,132
What are you doing?

99
00:03:16,132 --> 00:03:18,553
- I'm sewing the head
of a piglet onto a fish.

100
00:03:18,553 --> 00:03:19,855
(blowing nose)

101
00:03:19,855 --> 00:03:22,169
- Oh, yeah, hobbies are great.

102
00:03:22,169 --> 00:03:23,641
I do model trains.

103
00:03:23,641 --> 00:03:25,452
- Yeah, I'm sure you do, excuse me.

104
00:03:25,452 --> 00:03:28,791
- You're mother is one fine woman, Clay.

105
00:03:28,791 --> 00:03:31,233
Just between you and me, I wouldn't be

106
00:03:31,233 --> 00:03:33,687
expecting her home tonight.

107
00:03:33,687 --> 00:03:34,520
- Mother?

108
00:03:35,948 --> 00:03:37,495
- Hi, Sandy.

109
00:03:37,495 --> 00:03:40,449
- Pearl, you are looking...

110
00:03:40,449 --> 00:03:42,008
(grunts)

111
00:03:42,008 --> 00:03:43,628
- Well, it looks like
you two have had a chance

112
00:03:43,628 --> 00:03:44,631
to get to know each other.

113
00:03:44,631 --> 00:03:46,231
Okay, listen up, people.

114
00:03:46,231 --> 00:03:48,991
Mother is going out with
her friend, Sandy, tonight,

115
00:03:48,991 --> 00:03:50,519
