116
00:03:50,519 --> 00:03:51,477
(gasps)
- Crow!

117
00:03:51,477 --> 00:03:52,897
- Come on!
- [Gypsy] No way!

118
00:03:52,897 --> 00:03:55,490
- Sure, Pearl, now you
have yourself a good time

119
00:03:55,490 --> 00:03:57,382
and don't worry about a thing.

120
00:03:57,382 --> 00:03:58,215
(scoffing)

121
00:03:58,215 --> 00:03:59,521
- Man, man.

122
00:03:59,521 --> 00:04:01,663
- So, what Art says, goes, people,

123
00:04:01,663 --> 00:04:03,892
and that means you, too, Clayton.

124
00:04:03,892 --> 00:04:06,559
- Okay, you big babies,
here are the rules.

125
00:04:06,559 --> 00:04:08,073
Go to bed now and don't get up

126
00:04:08,073 --> 00:04:10,089
