in the garbage disposal.

127
00:04:10,089 --> 00:04:11,114
(screaming)

128
00:04:11,114 --> 00:04:12,244
Shut up, kid!

129
00:04:12,244 --> 00:04:13,425
- Look, Crow, there's no way.

130
00:04:13,425 --> 00:04:15,047
I'm bigger than you
and I'm older than you.

131
00:04:15,047 --> 00:04:16,625
There's no way you're my babysitter!

132
00:04:16,625 --> 00:04:18,487
- Just for that, you wash my feet.

133
00:04:18,487 --> 00:04:19,469
- Crow.
- [Crow] Shut up.

134
00:04:19,469 --> 00:04:20,302
- Crow.
- [Crow] Shut up!

135
00:04:20,302 --> 00:04:21,135
- Crow.
- [Crow] Shut up!

136
00:04:21,135 --> 00:04:21,968
- Crow.
- [Crow] Go to bed!

137
00:04:21,968 --> 00:04:22,801
- Crow.

138
00:04:22,801 --> 00:04:24,144
- You shall live.

139
00:04:24,144 --> 00:04:25,469
- Thank you.

140
00:04:25,469 --> 00:04:26,302
- Shut up!

141
00:04:26,302 --> 00:04:28,008
- Bye-bye, sweetie. (smooching)

142
00:04:28,008 --> 00:04:29,424
I'll be back whenever I feel like it

143
00:04:29,424 --> 00:04:31,030
and there's no number
where you can reach me.

144
00:04:31,030 --> 00:04:31,863
Chow!

145
00:04:33,765 --> 00:04:35,163
- Poom!

146
00:04:35,163 --> 00:04:36,580
- Oh, Mother, no!

147
00:04:39,429 --> 00:04:41,424
Oh, well, he's not the first oily man

148
00:04:41,424 --> 00:04:43,173
that's taken Mom to the mat.

149
00:04:43,173 --> 00:04:47,418
Your experiment this week
is a Rondo Hatton vehicle

150
00:04:47,418 --> 00:04:50,248
called "Brute Man", and
there's also a short.

151
00:04:50,248 --> 00:04:52,520
- Aren't you supposed to be in bed by now?

152
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,874
Get back into bed!

153
00:04:53,874 --> 00:04:55,240
Would you stop, would you stop?

154
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,680
(alarm buzzing)

155
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,544
What have you kids done?

156
00:04:57,544 --> 00:04:59,577
What have you done, you stupid kids!

157
00:04:59,577 --> 00:05:00,685
(door opening)

158
00:05:00,685 --> 00:05:02,412
(metal scraping)

159
00:05:02,412 --> 00:05:04,818
(slamming)
(chains clinking)

160
00:05:04,818 --> 00:05:07,573
(door sliding)
(beeping)

161
00:05:07,573 --> 00:05:08,966
(bolts clanking)

162
00:05:08,966 --> 00:05:10,448
(creaking)

163
