165
00:05:13,030 --> 00:05:14,848
- [Mike] Backwards jackass company.

166
00:05:14,848 --> 00:05:16,306
- The Bill Clinton story!

167
00:05:16,306 --> 00:05:17,234
(laughing)

168
00:05:17,234 --> 00:05:18,168
- [Tom] The Chicken of Tomorrow

169
00:05:18,168 --> 00:05:21,570
in a deadly battle against
the chicken of today.

170
00:05:21,570 --> 00:05:24,626
(old orchestral music)

171
00:05:24,626 --> 00:05:27,901
(clucking)
(slapping)

172
00:05:27,901 --> 00:05:29,671
- [Mike] I'm off, wait, there.

173
00:05:29,671 --> 00:05:30,504
- [Crow] Tempo.

174
00:05:30,504 --> 00:05:32,879
(old orchestral music)
(clucking)

175
00:05:32,879 --> 00:05:35,421
- Dedicated to the chickens
who lost their lives

176
00:05:35,421 --> 00:05:37,004
in the great chicken war.

177
00:05:37,004 --> 00:05:39,341
(old orchestral music)

178
00:05:39,341 --> 00:05:40,817
- [Mike] Wait a minute, men and women

179
00:05:40,817 --> 00:05:41,932
