2271
01:15:11,991 --> 01:15:13,271
- [Clifford] Virginia?

2272
01:15:13,271 --> 01:15:14,551
- There's Cliff.

2273
01:15:14,551 --> 01:15:16,258
- Tell him to come on up.

2274
01:15:16,258 --> 01:15:17,140
Go on.
- [Tom] But he's not

2275
01:15:17,140 --> 01:15:18,321
