2278
01:15:21,488 --> 01:15:23,728
(ominous orchestral music)

2279
01:15:23,728 --> 01:15:25,435
- [Tom] Oh, man, she's in the bedroom.

2280
01:15:25,435 --> 01:15:26,541
I can't believe it and I haven't

2281
01:15:26,541 --> 01:15:27,848
