2286
01:15:33,918 --> 01:15:35,518
- Hello, Cliff.

2287
01:15:35,518 --> 01:15:36,585
- It's Hal.

2288
01:15:36,585 --> 01:15:37,571
- [Crow] A.K.A, the creeper.

2289
01:15:37,571 --> 01:15:38,651
A.K.A. the brute.

2290
01:15:38,651 --> 01:15:39,484
- Hal.

2291
01:15:39,484 --> 01:15:41,758
- Yeah, it's been a long time, Cliff.

2292
01:15:41,758 --> 01:15:42,598
- [Crow] Yeah.

2293
01:15:42,598 --> 01:15:44,918
- I don't blame you
for not recognizing me.

2294
01:15:44,918 --> 01:15:47,211
- Cliff, they were
right, he is the creeper.

2295
01:15:47,211 --> 01:15:48,638
He killed those people.

2296
01:15:48,638 --> 01:15:49,651
