to me, thanks to you.

2302
01:15:58,705 --> 01:15:59,811
- [Crow] Awkward.

2303
01:15:59,811 --> 01:16:01,465
- Why would you come here?

2304
01:16:01,465 --> 01:16:02,946
- I need money.

2305
01:16:02,946 --> 01:16:04,571
- I told him we'd be glad to do anything

2306
01:16:04,571 --> 01:16:05,731
