2307
01:16:05,731 --> 01:16:07,011
- Yes, of course.

2308
01:16:07,011 --> 01:16:08,918
- Get those jewels of
mine in the wall safe.

2309
01:16:08,918 --> 01:16:10,168
- But, alright.

2310
01:16:11,305 --> 01:16:12,545
They're in here.

2311
01:16:12,545 --> 01:16:13,451
- [Crow] Oh, great.

2312
01:16:13,451 --> 01:16:15,718
- [Mike] You know my
Gallery mags are in here.

2313
01:16:15,718 --> 01:16:17,425
- [Crow] So, what else
have you been up to?

2314
01:16:17,425 --> 01:16:19,051
Been creeping a lot?

2315
01:16:19,051 --> 01:16:20,385
(cover clunking)

2316
01:16:20,385 --> 01:16:21,438
- [Tom] Let's see now.

2317
01:16:21,438 --> 01:16:22,605
One, one, one.

2318
01:16:23,905 --> 01:16:25,785
