2344
01:17:08,426 --> 01:17:09,651
- [Tom] Poor guy.

2345
01:17:09,651 --> 01:17:12,475
- I'm sorry, Hal, but I had to.

2346
01:17:12,475 --> 01:17:13,581
(orchestral swell)

2347
01:17:13,581 --> 01:17:14,768
- [Tom] Oh, I know, you're mad aren't you?

2348
01:17:14,768 --> 01:17:17,088
Just like when I deformed
your face, you're mad.

2349
01:17:17,088 --> 01:17:19,005
Kiss me, you brute man.

2350
01:17:21,061 --> 01:17:22,808
- Mr. Scott, Mr. Scott!

2351
01:17:22,808 --> 01:17:24,638
